{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:09 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:09 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:09 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"工人腳部遭重300公斤紙卷壓傷，警員調查案件。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/13d7390022cb8a83a8de3b30eff20a29/2026-11/page_102.jpg\"/><p>西貢發生工業意外。今日（11日）早上11時49分，一名男工人在康定路3號碼頭對開工作期間，據稱被重300公斤的紙卷砸傷腳。他痛極大叫呼救，驚動工友報警求助。救援人員到場，事主清醒被送往沙田威爾斯親王醫院治理。警方列作工業意外跟進調查。</p><img alt=\"男工被重300公斤的紙卷砸傷腳。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9a004c1cefcb89ca40147deafe28bed1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_40_5_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/21171bd2dc43e70ee43d2c63bdb6d85e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_40_4_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員在場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/79154e3ba7b9b42a0306e7c376723fc5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_40_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d5f14797e6c453117cf427c3f2dcf076/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4e2af108f2e904890c3c18b4a39b97b9/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_39_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e75b3fc7e79c2eea1c84cb18ad81e390/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_40_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"砸傷工人的紙卷重約300公斤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dd50a96e33bb220eba4d767b237d3160/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_39_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a9352453ed137896f54b552ff5c4efda/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_39_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cd3421115511bc7f5ebea3f93d1f09ce/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_13_19_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"傷者獲送院治理。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8117985ea4570eb83850f66b368d751b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_59_23.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工人清醒送院治理。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cda8e6c4e2b7347a0896f0dc98741baf/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-11_at_12_59_22.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T08:14:47.539485+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T05:09:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T08:28:40.050974+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T08:08:24.700787+00:00","content_hash":"1f8b92c87de5488e0f566239ae96e48471f3e2b992ce4126085c1bfd2fb6bc35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}